                     <code code="50565-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN SECTION"/>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>
                           <content styleCode="bold">Keep out of reach of children.</content>
                           <br/>In case of overdose, get medical help 
         or contact a Poison Control Center right away. Quick medical attention is critical for adults as well as for children even if you do not notice any signs or symptoms.

 </paragraph>
